`, `\s`, `[\s\S]`, `[
]`, `[[:space:]]` and `(.|
)` in that position are each 1; `.`, `[^x]`, `[^a-z]` and `[^[:alpha:]]` are each 404, and so is `[^x]{3}` for all three. So it is negation and nothing else — a positive class that names the newline still matches it — and it is the line break, not the dash or the bullet (`tapped, [^.]*one`, inside the line, is 1). This case ORs three of the 404s and is a 404 on both sides, measured as written; before the fix this port answered the card.
